\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Held-out generalization. Exec+STA achieves ISR/PR = 0.85 vs.\ 0.33 for exec-only, with hacking prevalence reduced from 45\% to 18\%. The base model's ISR/PR (0.53) exceeds trained exec-only (0.33)---exec-only training actively \emph  {worsens} structural quality.}}{5}{table.3}\protected@file@percent }
